WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Disastrous Power

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
ShineGreymon Runs Wild

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:07.510
Disastrous Power!

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.550
ShineGreymon Runs Wild!

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.940
What are you doing?!

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:23.020
This isn't the time to be playing around!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.940
I am not playing around.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:34.740
Tohma betrayed Masaru.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:41.370
He joined forces with Kurata on the condition that his little sister Relena's illness is cured.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.830
Welcome home, Tohma-kun.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:55.050
Let's create a new world together.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.240
Full Moon Blaster!

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:13.190
Are you okay with that?!

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:14.860
I simply obey my master!

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:18.390
I've lost respect for you!

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:20.080
Shining Blast!

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.140
Gale Claw!

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:33.550
Glorious Burst!

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:36.820
Full Moon Blaster!

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:45.460
Gale Claw!

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.990
Enough of this bullshit!

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:57.700
Then...

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:02.180
What was it that we've been doing all this time?

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.330
Do you need an answer?

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:06.460
We have nothing else to talk about!

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.090
STOP!

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:36.790
Unforgivable...

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.360
Tohma...

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:43.190
You are completely unforgivable!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.830
That Digisoul...

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.130
What is that?

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:15.290
Is that Burst Mode?

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:17.860
No.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:18.900
It can't be...

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.760
Dodge it, MirageGaogamon!

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.010
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:49.100
The Digimon who died during the battles like Baromon and ElDoradimon...

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:52.060
and Mercurimon and the others...

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:56.020
Apologize to them all with your <i>life</i> !

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.340
MirageGaogamon!

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.290
Master!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:02.440
Don't come any closer!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:10.870
Finish them!

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.530
Die, Tohma!!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:17.950
Don't!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.050
Chika!

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:23.960
Why do you have to fight with Tohma-kun?!

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.510
That doesn't make any sense!

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:51.160
What is he... doing?

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:54.370
BanchouLeomon!

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.340
He's rampaging.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:05:01.340
ShineGreymon is unable to control the destructive power of the Burst Mode.

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:02.880
What?!

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:12.040
Come back, MirageGaogamon!

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:24.880
Tohma!

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:32.710
Stop, ShineGreymon!

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:33.790
Stop it!

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:35.130
It's useless.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:40.200
Once the Burst Mode runs wild, no one can stop it.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.380
You have to wait until he destroys himself.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:43.250
No way!

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:52.200
We should withdraw as well.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:55.630
BanchouLeomon!

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:58.420
Take care of Chika for me!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.060
Masaru-niichan!

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.360
ShineGreymon!

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:11.750
Enough!

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.560
ShineGreymon!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.830
Stop!

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:18.360
Please!

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:23.130
Please stop!

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:46.610
ShineGreymon!

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.860
ShineGreymon...

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:23.720
No way...

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:25.690
Why...

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:31.340
Why did you turn back into a Digiegg?!

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:40.610
Why did he turn back into a Digiegg?

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:45.660
Maybe he used up all of his energy fighting with MirageGaogamon.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:48.730
Hey, how long does it take for a Digiegg to hatch?

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:50.520
No one knows.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.410
It could be a week, or a year...

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:56.680
It's also possible that it'll never hatch...

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.220
That won't happen!

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.450
I'm sure he'll hatch really soon!

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.200
I'm sure of it!

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:06.670
But even if he does, he won't have his previous memories.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.630
BanchouLeomon.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:14.780
When Agumon is reborn, he probably won't even remember the days he spent with you.

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:20.350
How do you plan on fighting Kurata without Agumon's help?

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.700
Daimon Masaru.

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.680
If only Tohma was around at a time like this...

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:27.220
DON'T...!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.110
Don't talk about him.

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:32.290
Masaru...

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.580
Gaomon, are you all right?

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.880
A wound this small is no problem, Master.

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:58.560
Doctor Tohma.

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:00.070
So you've arrived here safely.

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:03.210
Excuse me.

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.870
Your puppy was with you.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.020
I am not a dog!

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.020
Well, well.

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.190
Anyway, it was quite a surprise.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:15.160
I never would have guessed that ShineGreymon had that sort of power hidden within him.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:18.690
That most likely was not ShineGreymon's power.

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:19.440
Oh?

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:24.420
This Digivice increased Daimon Masaru's Digisoul to an explosive degree.

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.260
If I analyze this Digivice,

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:44.800
I should be able to draw out power for MirageGaogamon that surpasses ShineGreymon's.

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:48.310
There may be no need for you to do that.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:54.150
After all, ShineGreymon is now a Digiegg.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.190
What do you mean?

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:57.280
I don't know the reason behind it,

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:03.470
but what's certain is that he is no longer around to meddle with my ambitions.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:04.660
Your ambitions?

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:07.620
Let me show you.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:11.620
This is...

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.450
Belphemon.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:26.100
Belphemon Sleep Mode

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:26.100
Ultimate Level

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.260
Belphemon Sleep Mode.

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:21.950
An Ultimate Level Digimon who is one of the Seven Demon Lords.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:26.100
His cute sleeping face actually hides the enormous amount of his unimaginable power.

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:30.390
He is the ultimate weapon I've brought with me from the Digital World.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.800
Although he hasn't awakened yet.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:43.130
I found Belphemon deep within some ancient ruins in the Digital World.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:47.050
I thought it was strange...

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:52.960
Why did these Digimon, who held no concept of death, create a grave and seal a Digiegg within it?

00:11:52.960 --> 00:12:00.380
Perhaps it was something they had consigned 
to the dark depths of oblivion so that it could never be reawakened.

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:05.500
I brought the Digiegg to the human world, and as I nurtured it,

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:08.760
my doubts changed more and more into conviction...

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:14.730
That Belphemon is perhaps the greatest ultimate weapon in the world.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:16.480
I see.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:23.070
So the reason why you collected all of the Digimon's life energy was to revive this Belphemon.

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:24.480
Correct.

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:27.300
I've gathered all of the necessary energy.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:31.230
Now I can revive Belphemon!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.840
And then you will annihilate the Digimon.

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:36.600
That's what I had in mind at first.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:41.530
But now that I have the power of Belphemon in my hands,

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:44.630
that goal is much too insignificant!

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:53.060
Considering my position, I can use this power to control the human world!

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:53.880
Yes!

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:59.690
I will become the king who will rule over both this world and the Digital World!

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:02.980
I see.

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:06.490
I won't let you get away with that!

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:08.950
Kurata!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.060
Gaomon!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:14.630
Yes, Master!

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:16.190
Double Backhand!

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:19.000
Don't get in my way!

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:19.920
Ikuto!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:22.130
Shuririnken!

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:25.460
Uchitake Otoshi!

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:29.810
Gaomon!

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:33.250
Intruders!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.050
Don't let them escape! After them!

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:41.960
At this rate, Belphemon will be revived.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.780
We have to let Masaru and the others know!

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:46.170
Just a little more and I would've beaten Kurata!

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:46.900
Here they come, Ikuto!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.310
Professor Kurata.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.960
Please call off the Gizmon:XT.

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.960
Can I really count on you?

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:06.070
We can't let them get away after what they saw in the basement.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.140
Am I wrong?

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:09.380
Gaomon!

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:14.580
Digisoul Charge!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:15.690
Overdrive!

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:19.160
Gaomon, evolve!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.370
MirageGaogamon!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:43.330
Ikuto.

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:45.540
Digisoul...

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.010
Full Charge!

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:55.170
Peckmon, evolve!

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:15.160
Yatagaramon!

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:19.250
Are you seriously betraying us?

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:22.460
I simply obey my master's orders.

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:25.980
How about it? Did you find anything?

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.090
Not a thing.

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:31.610
There's nothing in DATS's database on how to hatch a Digiegg.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:34.530
Chief Yushima left for somewhere, too.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:36.960
What should we do now?

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.760
Yoshino, I sense a Digimon signal!

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.740
One of them is Yatagaramon...

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:44.140
The other is MirageGaogamon.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:44.980
What?

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:48.200
Are Tohma-kun and Ikuto-kun fighting?

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.620
There's no mistake.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.820
This is bad.

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:52.580
We have to stop Tohma-kun quickly!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:53.910
You can't go!

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.370
BanchouLeomon!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:58.370
I'm going!

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:01.290
And I just said you can't go!

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:04.330
Now that you've lost Agumon, what can you do on your own?

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:08.850
Even if I don't have him, I can still punch Tohma's lights out!

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:10.980
Were you not able to hear them?

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:12.300
Hear Agumon's screams?!

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:14.220
Agumon's... screams?

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.310
Yes!

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:20.830
The pained cries of his soul as he was flattened underneath your emotions!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:25.970
<i>Tohma...</i>

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:29.910
<i>You are completely unforgivable!</i>

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:49.950
<i>Finish them!</i>

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:52.590
Enveloped by your Digisoul of hatred...

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.550
<i>Die, Tohma!!</i>

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:55.470
he was suffering incredible pain...

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.400
And yet...

00:16:57.400 --> 00:17:00.300
not once did you even bother to listen to his cries.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.320
It's my fault?

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:11.970
You're saying Agumon turned back into a Digiegg...

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:14.900
because I didn't use the Burst Mode properly?

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:17.200
I thought I warned you.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.660
Burst Mode is a double-edged sword.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:22.870
If you make a mistake in using it, you will only end up hurting yourself.

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.080
I...

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:26.110
hurt Agumon...

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:31.250
Yatagaramon!

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:33.070
MirageGaogamon!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.260
Capture Ikuto!

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:35.890
Yes, Master!

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:38.780
Ikuto!

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:44.710
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:49.960
You're really serious!

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.850
Stop making me repeat myself.

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:54.440
I simply obey my master's orders!

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:56.940
Even when you know he's wrong?

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:58.410
Silence!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:01.070
I...

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:02.910
believe in the path that Master chooses!

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:07.120
I will continue to do so, even if it ends up sending him to Hell!

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:09.350
You blockhead!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.040
Gale Claw!

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:19.260
I'm really going to go.

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:20.470
I have to!

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:22.470
Don't you get it yet?!

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.270
I do.

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:28.470
My hatred turned Agumon into a Digiegg, right?

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:35.940
But even so, this feeling won't go away until I've settled things with Tohma!

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.400
If you keep getting in my way,

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.610
I'll just have to beat you first!

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:42.430
Masaru!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.370
Masaru-niichan!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.250
What?!

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.650
Suguru's fists...

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:55.670
shone a thousand times brighter than yours!

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.170
Dad's... fists?

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:02.760
A pure Digisoul will not be born from a fist of hatred!

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:07.640
Furthermore, mastering the Burst Mode will be a dream within a dream!

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:09.840
I'd thought...

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:14.150
that you would be the man who could surpass Suguru.

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:16.070
My... Dad...?

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.610
It's a pity.

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.530
That man...

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.870
Mikafutsu-no-kami!

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:38.330
Just what I expected from an Ultimate Level.

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:41.390
He repelled my Mikafutsu-no-kami with one hand!

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.270
Yatagaramon.

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:44.360
His wound...

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.010
<i>MirageGaogamon!</i>

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.520
ShineGreymon's attack hurt him!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.700
So if we aim for it...

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:55.020
Go, Yatagaramon!

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:58.850
Full Moon Blaster!

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:09.540
MirageGaogamon!

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:11.380
Take that!

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:11.750
Ikuto!

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:17.420
Since you've cornered MirageGaogamon this far, I've gotten a higher opinion of you.

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:19.630
But playtime is now over!

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:21.560
MirageGaogamon!

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:22.590
Yes, Master!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:26.860
Yatagaramon!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.850
Masaru!

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:30.260
Ikuto!

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.440
Ikuto!!

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:46.820
Ikuto!

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:50.500
Ikuto!!!

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.170
Well done.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.790
You've dealt with the witnesses.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:01.200
It's not just ShineGreymon,

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:05.170
but it may be safe to say that there is absolutely no one who will interfere with me now.

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.040
Yes.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:10.250
Now you will be able to achieve your goals.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.270
Exactly.

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:13.970
Now,

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:18.580
let us take our first step into the new world!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:26.240
Yes?

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:33.020
It's time for doctor's rounds.

