<b>ENDING THEME 

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:38.950
Awaken, Belphemon!

00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:42.920
The day the world becomes mine has finally come!

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:43.830
Damn it!

00:22:43.830 --> 00:22:47.020
I'm the only one who can't do anything at a time like this!

